OL,3,GNEWSABank cashier outed by holiday
OL,4,Aphotos after stealing #13k is ordered
OL,5,Ato pay back money
OL,6,
OL,7,FA building society cashier who stole
OL,8,Fthousands of pounds from customers to
OL,9,Fpay for "lavish" holidays has been
OL,10,Fordered to repay more than #12,000.
OL,12,FKelly Kershaw, 54, stole #13,333
OL,13,Fincluding from vulnerable and elderly
OL,14,Fcustomers at Nationwide in Caernarfon,
OL,15,FGwynedd, even forging the signature of
OL,16,Fa man with learning disabilities.
OL,18,FKershaw admitted five counts of fraud
OL,19,Fafter colleagues spotted Facebook posts
OL,20,Fof her on safari in Africa, and on
OL,21,Ftrips to Paris, Tuscany and Dubai.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
