OL,3,GNEWSABank cashier outed by holiday
OL,4,Aphotos after stealing #13k is ordered
OL,5,Ato pay back money
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was jailed for 16 months in May but
OL,8,Freturned to Caernarfon Crown Court for
OL,9,Fa Proceeds of Crime Act hearing, and
OL,10,Ftold to pay back #12,630.
